<title>USA: Boeing and McDonnell in collaboration pact.</title>
<headline>Boeing and McDonnell in collaboration pact.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, Calif. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co. and McDonnell Douglas Corp. reached an agreement Tuesday to collaborate on future Boeing wide-body commercial airplane programs.</p>
<p>In a joint statement, the aerospace companies said the first project McDonnell Douglas will participate in is the development of proposed new versions of the Boeing 747 jumbo jet.</p>
</text>
